  "paper_scope": "The paper develops an alternated continuous-time random walk (A-CTRW) model for colloid filtration in a heterogeneous porous medium, linking pore-scale flight-dive dynamics to macroscopic deposition profiles and breakthrough curves. The supplement derives the flight-size PDF under different pore-length and diving-rate assumptions. The selected cluster focuses on the two constant-diving-rate regimes: constant pore length and exponentially distributed pore length.",
